      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PAW OLIVE (2) had a tricky draw last time and although midfield in fifth wasn't far away finishing 4.5 lengths from the winner (22.86). Solid record here at the distance winning five races. Tough to beat if on-song. BEAST POWER (1) finds it hard to win. Better run when finding the frame last time though, finishing third (24.87) at this track. Expected to be in this for a long way. UNLEASHING (4) has been out of the placings at his last couple but on the winners' heels when placing three back (25.98) in a Grade 5 at Ballarat. Has the ability and can find best this time. CALL IT FATE (6) racing over this course and distance brings the best out in her.",
